    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/e970d343cfd5e5c1a5b5304434610bed.webp?t=1708538902\" /></div><br><br>Welcome to <strong>SuperColony</strong>, the captivating ant colony simulation game inspired by the intricate behaviors of insects and the best elements of RTS and Colony-Simulation games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage the Colony and Grow your Empire:</h2>Direct your ants through the world using pheromone markers, guiding them with war, scouting, and harvest pheromones. Watch as your entire colony responds to your commands with complex behaviors.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight Insects and Unlock Genetic Abilities:</h2>Harvest resources and genetic abilities from defeated insects. Learn to fly like Ladybugs or spin webs from Arachnids, but be prepared for challenging battles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Evolve and Customize Your Ant Colony:</h2>Collect DNA points from the environment to unlock genes and evolve your ants into specialized castes. Experiment with unique abilities like flying, web-slinging, and explosions.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Gene Tree as you Find New Genes in the World:</h2>With 6 parts on each ant, the number of potential combinations for building new ant castes is vast. Try different combinations for different situations and strategies.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thrive in a Dynamic Environment:</h2>Your actions impact the world; killing all the Ladybugs may unleash chaos with the Aphids. Explore, adapt, and learn from your surroundings to thrive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The ultimate goal is to create new queens with valuable genes, expanding your ant societies and advancing toward building a global SuperColony.<br><br>Join the adventure in SuperColony today and experience the fascinating world of ants!",
    "about_the_game": "<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/e970d343cfd5e5c1a5b5304434610bed.webp?t=1708538902\" /></div><br><br>Welcome to <strong>SuperColony</strong>, the captivating ant colony simulation game inspired by the intricate behaviors of insects and the best elements of RTS and Colony-Simulation games.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Manage the Colony and Grow your Empire:</h2>Direct your ants through the world using pheromone markers, guiding them with war, scouting, and harvest pheromones. Watch as your entire colony responds to your commands with complex behaviors.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/9babbeebdc364002c1df2bd4aea7f07c.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight Insects and Unlock Genetic Abilities:</h2>Harvest resources and genetic abilities from defeated insects. Learn to fly like Ladybugs or spin webs from Arachnids, but be prepared for challenging battles.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/4282add7ee24843be862e9a8e3d3046b.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Evolve and Customize Your Ant Colony:</h2>Collect DNA points from the environment to unlock genes and evolve your ants into specialized castes. Experiment with unique abilities like flying, web-slinging, and explosions.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/92ebde36393a397b1109518de7d8a936.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore the Gene Tree as you Find New Genes in the World:</h2>With 6 parts on each ant, the number of potential combinations for building new ant castes is vast. Try different combinations for different situations and strategies.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6b4e575c78188f9831d78885b23f3602.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thrive in a Dynamic Environment:</h2>Your actions impact the world; killing all the Ladybugs may unleash chaos with the Aphids. Explore, adapt, and learn from your surroundings to thrive.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.poster.avif?t=1708538902\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.webm?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1815650/extras/6761747fd42f59014cf14b9dee0e75a1.mp4?t=1708538902\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>The ultimate goal is to create new queens with valuable genes, expanding your ant societies and advancing toward building a global SuperColony.<br><br>Join the adventure in SuperColony today and experience the fascinating world of ants!",
    "short_description": "A real-time ant colony simulation game set in the hostile world of insects. Fight for resources, build underground networks, learn from the environment, harvest DNA from defeated foes, evolve new ant abilities, and guide hundreds of ants toward building a global SuperColony. Add to Wishlist now!",
